Homeowner tax exemption-amendments. 25LSO-0321, 1.1
FISCAL NOTE
This bill contains an appropriation of $176,000,000 from the GENERAL FUND (GF) to
the Department of Revenue (DOR). This appropriation is effective immediately.
DETAIL OF APPROPRIATION
Agency #: 011 Agency Name: Department of Revenue
Unit: (new) Property tax exemption
